== Trivia ==
* This item is a reference to one of Edmund McMillen's previous games, [[Wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|Super Meat Boy]].
** {{dlc|r}} Picking this item up as {{C|Keeper}} makes his face similar to that of [[supermeatboy:Tofu Boy|Tofu Boy]].
* In ''Wrath of the Lamb'', this item was originally unlocked by beating a challenge titled, "Meat 4 Evar!".
* In the Spanish language, this item was initially called "SMB super ventilador" meaning "SMB super ventilator"

